// Ch6 B01, walking banter 2 (act1_ch06.md; W02): the midday stop on a hull. Everyone eats, and
// Kerrid doesn't. The insert holds his share untouched beside him (the second clue after Ch5's
// bowl). No line from him; Rhen takes it after a while. In-engine, played by the layout's trigger.
